T*
(3.1 This Agreement begins on the Effective Date and continues for an initial term of) Tj T*
(thirty-six \(36\) months \(the “Initial Term”\).) Tj T*
T*
(3.2 At the end of the Initial Term, this Agreement will automatically renew for successive) Tj T*
